[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925084950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106989#issuecomment-2925084950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106989","id":2925084950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uWUEW","user":{"login":"Zylann","id":1311555,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTE1NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1311555?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann","html_url":"https://github.com/Zylann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zylann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T12:02:49Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T12:03:05Z","body":"Using `.0` means the number will be a float, which is 32-bit in official builds of Godot.\nAccording to https://stackoverflow.com/questions/3793838/which-is-the-first-integer-that-an-ieee-754-float-is-incapable-of-representing-e, the maximum integer a float can represent accurately is `16777216`.\nAlso checked in https://godbolt.org/z/EoY39den8\n\nCuriously, your number `12345678` is smaller than that. So getting such truncated result is unexpected. Perhaps precision got lost in text formatting?\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925084950/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925211703","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106989#issuecomment-2925211703","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106989","id":2925211703,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uWzA3","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T13:46:57Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T13:46:57Z","body":"- Fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98750?\n\nThe PR even mentions the numbers you gave as an example.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925211703/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925471993","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106989#issuecomment-2925471993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106989","id":2925471993,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6uXyj5","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-31T17:23:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-31T17:23:03Z","body":"> * Fixed by [Use Grisu2 algorithm in `String::num_scientific` to fix serializing #98750](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98750)?\n\nCan't reproduce the issue in the current `master` (v4.5.dev.custom_build [eb72ce2db]) so it is fixed. Probably by that PR indeed.\n\n---\n\n> Using `.0` means the number will be a float, which is 32-bit in official builds of Godot.\n\nThat's true for vectors, packed arrays, etc. but not for a plain GDScript-`float`, it's 64-bit.\n\n> Curiously, your number `12345678` is smaller than that. So getting such truncated result is unexpected. Perhaps precision got lost in text formatting?\n\nIndeed, saving the scene in a binary format (`.scn` instead of `.tscn`) makes the issue go away in v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6].","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2925471993/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]